  "body": "Synapse have useful [Purge Remote Media API](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/docs/admin_api/purge_remote_media.rst) that clean ups `remote_content` and `remote_thumbnail` folders. \r\nBut Synapse `media` storage have another folders that we can cleanup:\r\n- url_cache\r\n- url_cache_thumbnails\r\n- local_thumbnails\r\n\r\nWill be good to extend [Purge Remote Media API](https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/blob/master/docs/admin_api/purge_remote_media.rst) or provide separate admin API for cleaning up those folders too.\r\n\r\nAlso will be good to have separate hard option for clearing too old `local_content` too.",
